  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Boil a saucepan of salted water. Cook the bean sprouts for <b>4 minutes</b>, then lift them out. Dip the spinach in for <b>30 seconds</b>, rinse in cold water and squeeze dry.</li><li>Season each separately with a pinch of salt, <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-s=\"0\">½ tsp</span> sesame oil and a little minced garlic.</li></ul>",
