   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the carrot and courgette into matchsticks and slice the shiitake. Heat a little oil in the steel pan on <b>medium-high</b>.</li><li>Cook each one in turn and set them aside in separate heaps: carrot with a pinch of salt for <b>1 minute</b>, courgette with a pinch of salt for <b>1 minute</b>, shiitake with the soy sauce for <b>2 minutes</b>.</li><li>Warm the bulgogi in the pan for a minute.</li></ul>",
