  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wipe the pan again and add <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> sesame oil</b>. Press the rice into an even layer about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> thick and cook on <b>medium</b> without stirring for <b>5–6 minutes</b>, until the bottom is golden and crackles.</li><li>Lift it out in pieces with a spatula, crust side down, into the two bowls. Or skip this and use soft warm rice.</li></ul>",
