  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Arrange the vegetables and bulgogi in separate heaps around the rice, like the spokes of a wheel. Put an egg in the centre.</li><li>Mix the gochujang with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tsp</span> sesame oil, the sugar, vinegar and sesame seeds, or the soy, sesame oil and spring onion for the mild sauce. Add a spoonful to each bowl and mix everything together at the table.</li></ul>",
